SAU0_INIT_REGION|Enable this region|||||Activate the region initialisation. If no initialisation all fields are forced to 0x00
SAU0_INIT_START|Start Address|||0x00000000|0xFFFFFFFF|Start address of this region
SAU0_INIT_SIZE|Block Size|||0x20|0xFFFFFFFF|Size of this region Used to compute the end address of this region
SAU0_INIT_END|End Address|||||
SAU0_INIT_NSC|Secure Attribute|||||Region could be defined as - Non-Secure - Secure with Non-Secure Callable
